    obo:IAO_0000115 "The CRF sector (IPCC 2006): 'CO2 emissions from biomass' is a sector defined by the 2006 IPCC Guidelines for National Greenhouse Gas Inventories: CO2 emissions from biomass combustion are not included in national totals, but are recorded as an information item for cross-checking purposes as well as avoiding double counting." ;
