    rdfs:label "CRF sector (IPCC 2006): chemical industry - other"@en ;
    obo:BFO_0000050 :OEO_00010166 ;
    obo:IAO_0000115 """The CRF sector (IPCC 2006) 'chemical industry - other' is an industry sector defined by the 2006 IPCC Guidelines for National Greenhouse Gas Inventories:
For example, gases with global warming potential listed in IPCC assessment reports that do not fall within any categories above could be reported here, if they are estimated.""" ;
    obo:IAO_0000119 "2006 IPCC Guidelines for National Greenhouse Gas Inventories, Volume 1, Chapter 8.5, https://www.ipcc-nggip.iges.or.jp/public/2006gl/" ;
