pull request: https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/ontology/pull/1724""" .

:OEO_00010364 a owl:NamedIndividual,
        :OEO_00000227 ;
    rdfs:label "CRF sector (IPCC 2006): TFT flat panel display"@en ;
    obo:BFO_0000050 :OEO_00010170 ;
    obo:IAO_0000115 """The CRF sector (IPCC 2006) 'TFT flat panel display' is an industry sector defined by the 2006 IPCC Guidelines for National Greenhouse Gas Inventories:
Uses and emissions of predominantly CF4, CHF3, NF3 and SF6 during the fabrication of thin-film transistors (TFTs) on glass substrates for flat panel display manufacture. In addition to these gases, C2F6, C3F8 and c-C4F8 may also be used and emitted during the manufacture of thin and smart displays.""" ;
    obo:IAO_0000119 "2006 IPCC Guidelines for National Greenhouse Gas Inventories, Volume 1, Chapter 8.5, https://www.ipcc-nggip.iges.or.jp/public/2006gl/" ;
    :OEO_00000504 :OEO_00000242 ;
    :OEO_00010037 "CRF 2.E.2" ;
    :OEO_00020426 """issue: https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/ontology/issues/1401
