:OEO_00020168 a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "fixed cost"@en ;
    obo:IAO_0000112 "rent, regular technical maintenance cost, staff cost, certification cost" ;
    obo:IAO_0000115 "A fixed cost is a cost for operation and maintenance that does not vary with the amount of goods or services produced." ;
    obo:IAO_0000118 "Fixkosten"@de,
        "fixed operation and maintenance cost"@en ;
    obo:IAO_0000119 """oemof-Model: https://oemof-solph.readthedocs.io/en/latest/_modules/oemof/solph/options.html?highlight=fix%20costs

Fixe Kosten: Kosten, die von der jeweils betrachteten Einflussgröße bzw. Entscheidung unabhängig sind, d.h. Kosten, die sich nicht mit der jeweils betrachteten Einflussgröße ändern. (https://wirtschaftslexikon.gabler.de/definition/fixe-kosten-33359)""" ;
    rdfs:subClassOf :OEO_00040009 ;
    :OEO_00020426 """issue: https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/ontology/issues/891
pull request: https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/ontology/pull/1022

Reformulate definition to singular:
issue: https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/ontology/issues/1257
pull request: https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/ontology/pull/1260

make subclass of process attribute
issue: https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/ontology/issues/1914
pull request: https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/ontology/pull/1999""" .

:OEO_00020169 a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "equipment cost"@en ;
    obo:IAO_0000115 "Equipment cost is an investment cost for acquisition of the components and machinery including environmental facilities." ;
    obo:IAO_0000118 "Ausrüstungskosten"@de ;
    rdfs:subClassOf :OEO_00020167 ;
    :OEO_00020426 """issue: https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/ontology/issues/891
pull request: https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/ontology/pull/1022

