:OEO_00050016 a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "final energy consumption value"@en ;
    obo:IAO_0000115 "A final energy consumption value is an energy consumption value expressing the magnitude of the energy delivered to and consumed by end users."@en ;
    obo:IAO_0000118 "Endenergieverbrauch"@de,
        "final energy consumption"@en ;
    rdfs:subClassOf :OEO_00240019 ;
    owl:equivalentClass [ a owl:Class ;
            owl:intersectionOf ( :OEO_00240019 [ a owl:Restriction ;
                        owl:onProperty obo:IAO_0000136 ;
                        owl:someValuesFrom [ a owl:Restriction ;
                                owl:onProperty obo:RO_0000057 ;
                                owl:someValuesFrom :OEO_00140080 ] ] ) ] ;
    :OEO_00020425 "study descriptor tag" ;
    :OEO_00020426 """issue: https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/ontology/issues/576
pull request: https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/ontology/pull/613

Make 'energy consumption value'
issue: https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/ontology/issues/1322
pull request: https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/ontology/pull/1340

Add axiom 
issue: https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/ontology/issues/1832
pull request: https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/ontology/pull/1841

add oekg annotation
issue: https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/ontology/issues/2063
pull request: https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/ontology/pull/2065""" .

:OEO_00090002 a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "public funder"@en ;
    obo:IAO_0000115 "A public funder is a funder that gives public money." ;
    obo:IAO_0000118 "öffentlicher Förderer"@de ;
    rdfs:subClassOf :OEO_00090001 ;
    :OEO_00020426 """issue: https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/ontology/issues/246
pull request: https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/ontology/pull/776""" .

:OEO_00090003 a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "private funder"@en ;
    obo:IAO_0000115 "A private funder is a funder that gives private money." ;
    obo:IAO_0000118 "privater Förderer"@de ;
    rdfs:subClassOf :OEO_00090001 ;
    :OEO_00020426 """issue: https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/ontology/issues/246
pull request: https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/ontology/pull/776""" .

:OEO_00110012 a owl:AnnotationProperty ;
    rdfs:label "mathematical expression"@en ;
    obo:IAO_0000115 "A mathematical expression is an annotation property that describes the class with a mathematical formula in LaTeX syntax."@en ;
    :OEO_00020426 """issue: https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/ontology/issues/987
pull request: https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/ontology/pull/990"""@en .

:OEO_00140006 a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "private transport"@en ;
    obo:IAO_0000115 "A private transport is a passenger transport in which people use their own vehicle for movement e.g. bicycle, motorcycle and cars." ;
    obo:IAO_0000118 "Individualverkehr"@de ;
    rdfs:subClassOf :OEO_00010263 ;
    :OEO_00020426 """issue: https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/ontology/issues/503
pull request: https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/ontology/pull/517

Make subclass of 'passenger transport'
issue: https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/ontology/issues/1055
pull request: https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/ontology/pull/1234

rework module structure 
issue: https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/ontology/issues/1592
pull request: https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/ontology/pull/1652""" .

:OEO_00140007 a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "public transport"@en ;
    obo:IAO_0000115 "A public transport is a passenger transport in which a number of passengers share a common vehicle." ;
    obo:IAO_0000118 "öffentlicher Verkehr"@de ;
    rdfs:subClassOf :OEO_00010263 ;
    :OEO_00020426 """issue: https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/ontology/issues/503
pull request: https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/ontology/pull/517

Make subclass of 'passenger transport'
issue: https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/ontology/issues/1055
