add axiom to oeo-shared-axioms
issue: https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/ontology/issues/1902
pull request: https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/ontology/pull/1915""" .

:OEO_00240038 a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "personal living space"@en ;
    obo:IAO_0000115 "A personal living space is a space requirement that one person uses for living."@en ;
    rdfs:subClassOf :OEO_00020136 ;
    :OEO_00020426 """issue: https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/ontology/issues/1056
