issue: https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/ontology/issues/1907
pull request: https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/ontology/pull/1928""" .

:OEO_00360010 a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "climate neutrality criterion"@en ;
    obo:IAO_0000115 "A climate neutrality criterion is a plan specification that intends to describe a state in which human activities result in no net effect on the climate system."@en ;
    rdfs:comment "There are several climate neutrality criteria defined, e.g. by UNFCCC, IPCC or other institutions, with more or less differing sprecifications. A climate neutrality criterion usually includes net-zero emissions but might, e.g. include non-emission effects like surface albedo."@en ;
    rdfs:subClassOf obo:IAO_0000104 ;
    :OEO_00020426 """issue: https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/ontology/issues/1392
pull request: https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/ontology/pull/1722

add oekg annotation
issue: https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/ontology/issues/1529
pull request: https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/ontology/pull/1897

remove oekg annotation
issue: https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/ontology/issues/2063
pull request: https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/ontology/pull/2065""" .

:OEO_00360013 a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "climate neutral process"@en ;
    obo:IAO_0000115 "A climate neutral process is a process that has a process climate neutrality attribute."@en ;
    rdfs:subClassOf obo:BFO_0000015 ;
    owl:equivalentClass [ a owl:Class ;
            owl:intersectionOf ( obo:BFO_0000015 [ a owl:Restriction ;
                        owl:onProperty :OEO_00000500 ;
                        owl:someValuesFrom :OEO_00360011 ] ) ] ;
    :OEO_00020426 """issue: https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/ontology/issues/1392
pull request: https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/ontology/pull/1722""" .

:OEO_00360014 a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "material climate neutrality"@en ;
    obo:IAO_0000115 "Material climate neutrality is a disposition of a material entity that conforms to some climate neutrality criterion."@en ;
    rdfs:subClassOf obo:BFO_0000016 ;
    :OEO_00020425 "study descriptor tag" ;
    :OEO_00020426 """issue: https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/ontology/issues/1392
pull request: https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/ontology/pull/1722

add oekg annotation
issue: https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/ontology/issues/2063
pull request: https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/ontology/pull/2065""" .

:OEO_00360016 a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "power system resilience"@en ;
    obo:IAO_0000115 "Power system resilience is the resilience of a power system that represents the ability to limit the extent, system impact, and duration of degradation in order to sustain critical services following an extraordinary event."@en ;
    obo:IAO_0000119 "A. M. Stanković et al., \"Methods for Analysis and Quantification of Power System Resilience,\" in IEEE Transactions on Power Systems, vol. 38, no. 5, pp. 4774-4787, Sept. 2023, doi: 10.1109/TPWRS.2022.3212688." ;
    rdfs:comment "Key enablers for a resilient response include the capacity to anticipate, absorb, rapidly recover from, adapt to, and learn from such an event. Extraordinary events for the power system may be caused by natural threats, accidents, equipment failures, and deliberate physical or cyber-attacks."@en ;
    rdfs:subClassOf [ a owl:Restriction ;
            owl:onProperty obo:RO_0000052 ;
            owl:someValuesFrom :OEO_00360017 ],
        :OEO_00360015 ;
    :OEO_00020426 """issue: https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/ontology/issues/1550
pull request: https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/ontology/pull/1744

replaced 'has bearer' with 'characteristic of'
issue: https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/ontology/issues/1907
pull request: https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/ontology/pull/1928""" .

:OEO_00360029 a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "priority region"@en ;
    obo:IAO_0000115 "A priority region is a region of relevance that has the priority region role."@en ;
    obo:IAO_0000118 "Vorranggebiet"@de ;
    obo:IAO_0000119 "See German spatial planning law: §7 Absatz 3 ROG: https://www.gesetze-im-internet.de/rog_2008/__7.html" ;
    rdfs:subClassOf :OEO_00360020 ;
    owl:equivalentClass [ a owl:Class ;
            owl:intersectionOf ( :OEO_00360020 [ a owl:Restriction ;
                        owl:onProperty obo:RO_0000087 ;
                        owl:someValuesFrom :OEO_00360026 ] ) ] ;
    :OEO_00020426 """issue: https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/ontology/issues/1766
pull request: https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/ontology/pull/1791""" .

:OEO_00360030 a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "conditionally reserved region"@en ;
    obo:IAO_0000115 "A conditionally reserved region is a region of relevance that has the conditionally reserved region role."@en ;
    obo:IAO_0000118 "Vorbehaltsgebiet"@de ;
    obo:IAO_0000119 "See German spatial planning law: §7 Absatz 3 ROG: https://www.gesetze-im-internet.de/rog_2008/__7.html" ;
    rdfs:subClassOf :OEO_00360020 ;
    owl:equivalentClass [ a owl:Class ;
            owl:intersectionOf ( :OEO_00360020 [ a owl:Restriction ;
                        owl:onProperty obo:RO_0000087 ;
                        owl:someValuesFrom :OEO_00360027 ] ) ] ;
    :OEO_00020426 """issue: https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/ontology/issues/1766
pull request: https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/ontology/pull/1791""" .

:OEO_00360031 a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "suitable region"@en ;
    obo:IAO_0000115 "A suitable region is a region of relevance that has the suitable region role."@en ;
    obo:IAO_0000118 "Eignungsgebiet"@de ;
    obo:IAO_0000119 "See German spatial planning law: §7 Absatz 3 ROG: https://www.gesetze-im-internet.de/rog_2008/__7.html" ;
    rdfs:subClassOf :OEO_00360020 ;
    owl:equivalentClass [ a owl:Class ;
            owl:intersectionOf ( :OEO_00360020 [ a owl:Restriction ;
                        owl:onProperty obo:RO_0000087 ;
                        owl:someValuesFrom :OEO_00360028 ] ) ] ;
    :OEO_00020426 """issue: https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/ontology/issues/1766
pull request: https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/ontology/pull/1791""" .

:OEO_00360032 a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "priority region with effect of suitable region"@en ;
    obo:IAO_0000115 "A priority region with effect of suitable region is a region of relevance that has both the priority region role and the suitable region role."@en ;
    obo:IAO_0000118 "Vorranggebiet mit der Wirkung eines Eignungsgebiets"@de ;
    obo:IAO_0000119 "See German spatial planning law:  §7 Absatz 3 ROG: https://www.gesetze-im-internet.de/rog_2008/__7.html" ;
    rdfs:subClassOf :OEO_00360020 ;
    owl:equivalentClass [ a owl:Class ;
            owl:intersectionOf ( :OEO_00360020 [ a owl:Restriction ;
                        owl:onProperty obo:RO_0000087 ;
                        owl:someValuesFrom :OEO_00360026 ] [ a owl:Restriction ;
                        owl:onProperty obo:RO_0000087 ;
                        owl:someValuesFrom :OEO_00360028 ] ) ] ;
    :OEO_00020426 """issue: https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/ontology/issues/1766
pull request: https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/ontology/pull/1791""" .

:OEO_00360033 a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "spatial planning policy"@en ;
    obo:IAO_0000115 "Spatial planning policy is a policy of a German federal state that designates portions of a spatial region to purposes like settlement, infrastructur and sustainability."@en ;
    rdfs:subClassOf :OEO_00140150 ;
    :OEO_00020426 """issue: https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/ontology/issues/1766
pull request: https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/ontology/pull/1791""" .

:OEO_00360041 a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "critical infrastructure"@en ;
    obo:IAO_0000115 "A critical infrastructure is an infrastructure system that has the critical infrastructure role, i.e. that is assessed to be crucial for the preservation of societal functions, health, safety and economical or social welfare."@en ;
    obo:IAO_0000119 "The definition is based on information obtained from https://eur-lex.europa.eu/legal-content/DE/TXT/?uri=CELEX:32008L0114 and https://de.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=Kritische_Infrastrukturen&oldid=240000353 in January 2024."@en ;
    rdfs:subClassOf www:ont00000870 ;
    owl:equivalentClass [ a owl:Class ;
            owl:intersectionOf ( www:ont00000870 [ a owl:Class ;
                        owl:unionOf ( [ a owl:Restriction ;
                                    owl:onProperty obo:BFO_0000051 ;
                                    owl:someValuesFrom [ a owl:Class ;
                                            owl:intersectionOf ( :OEO_00000061 [ a owl:Restriction ;
                                                        owl:onProperty obo:RO_0000087 ;
                                                        owl:someValuesFrom :OEO_00360040 ] ) ] ] [ a owl:Restriction ;
                                    owl:onProperty obo:RO_0000087 ;
                                    owl:someValuesFrom :OEO_00360040 ] ) ] ) ] ;
    :OEO_00020426 """issue: https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/ontology/issues/1792
pull request: https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/ontology/pull/1809

make subclass of supply system, edit axiom:
issue: https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/ontology/issues/1833
pull request: https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/ontology/pull/1947

made subclass of CCO infrastructure system
issue: https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/ontology/issues/2151""" .

:OEO_00360042 a owl:NamedIndividual,
        :OEO_00000158 ;
    rdfs:label "BSI-KritisV energy sector"@en ;
    obo:IAO_0000115 "The BSI-KritisV energy sector is an energy transformation sector defined by the BSI-KritisV sector division (§ 2 BSI-KritisV)."@en ;
    obo:IAO_0000119 "This class is defined by the German BSI-Kritisverordnung § 2, for reference see for example: https://www.gesetze-im-internet.de/bsi-kritisv/BJNR095800016.html"@en ;
    :OEO_00000504 :OEO_00360044 ;
