issue: https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/ontology/issues/2099
pull request: https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/ontology/pull/2124""" .

:OEO_00400014 a owl:NamedIndividual,
        :OEO_00400013 ;
    rdfs:label "ambiguous uncertainty"@en ;
    obo:IAO_0000115 "Ambiguous uncertainty is a nature of model uncertainty that stems from multiple frames of reference about a phenomenon existing similtaneously." ;
    obo:IAO_0000118 "ambiguity of uncertainty"@en ;
    obo:IAO_0000119 "https://www.researchgate.net/publication/264816512_Classifying_and_communicating_uncertainties_in_model-based_policy_analysis" ;
    :OEO_00020426 """issue: https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/ontology/issues/1829
pull request: https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/ontology/pull/1945""" .

:OEO_00400015 a owl:NamedIndividual,
        :OEO_00400013 ;
    rdfs:label "epistemological uncertainty"@en ;
    obo:IAO_0000115 "Epistemological uncertainty is a nature of model uncertainty that stems from a lack of knowledge about a certain phenomenon." ;
    obo:IAO_0000118 "epistemology of uncertainty"@en ;
    obo:IAO_0000119 "https://www.researchgate.net/publication/264816512_Classifying_and_communicating_uncertainties_in_model-based_policy_analysis" ;
    :OEO_00020426 """issue: https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/ontology/issues/1829
pull request: https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/ontology/pull/1945""" .

:OEO_00400016 a owl:NamedIndividual,
        :OEO_00400013 ;
    rdfs:label "ontological uncertainty"@en ;
    obo:IAO_0000115 "Ontological uncertainty is a nature of model uncertainty that stems from inherent variability of a phenomenon." ;
    obo:IAO_0000118 "ontology of uncertainty"@en ;
    obo:IAO_0000119 "https://www.researchgate.net/publication/264816512_Classifying_and_communicating_uncertainties_in_model-based_policy_analysis" ;
    :OEO_00020426 """issue: https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/ontology/issues/1829
pull request: https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/ontology/pull/1945""" .

:OEO_00400018 a owl:NamedIndividual,
        :OEO_00400017 ;
    rdfs:label "shallow uncertainty"@en ;
    obo:IAO_0000115 "Shallow uncertainty is a level of model uncertainty at which one can enumerate multiple alternatives and provide probabilites(subjective or objective) for them." ;
    obo:IAO_0000119 "https://www.researchgate.net/publication/264816512_Classifying_and_communicating_uncertainties_in_model-based_policy_analysis" ;
    :OEO_00020426 """issue: https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/ontology/issues/1829
pull request: https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/ontology/pull/1945""" .

:OEO_00400019 a owl:NamedIndividual,
        :OEO_00400017 ;
    rdfs:label "medium uncertainty"@en ;
    obo:IAO_0000115 "Medium uncertainty is a level of model uncertainty at which one can enumerate multiple alternatives and rank them in order of perceived likelihood, without being able to discern how intensely the likelihood varies between two alternatives." ;
    obo:IAO_0000119 "https://www.researchgate.net/publication/264816512_Classifying_and_communicating_uncertainties_in_model-based_policy_analysis" ;
    :OEO_00020426 """issue: https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/ontology/issues/1829
pull request: https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/ontology/pull/1945""" .

:OEO_00400020 a owl:NamedIndividual,
        :OEO_00400017 ;
    rdfs:label "deep uncertainty"@en ;
    obo:IAO_0000115 "Deep uncertainty is a level of model uncertainty at which one can enumerate multiple alternatives, without being able to rank them in order of likelihood." ;
    obo:IAO_0000119 "https://www.researchgate.net/publication/264816512_Classifying_and_communicating_uncertainties_in_model-based_policy_analysis" ;
    :OEO_00020426 """issue: https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/ontology/issues/1829
pull request: https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/ontology/pull/1945""" .

:OEO_00400021 a owl:NamedIndividual,
        :OEO_00400017 ;
    rdfs:label "recognised ignorance"@en ;
    obo:IAO_0000115 "Recognised ignorance is a level of model uncertainty at which one isn't able to enumerate multiple alternatives, while admitting the possibility of being surprised." ;
    obo:IAO_0000119 "https://www.researchgate.net/publication/264816512_Classifying_and_communicating_uncertainties_in_model-based_policy_analysis" ;
    :OEO_00020426 """issue: https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/ontology/issues/1829
pull request: https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/ontology/pull/1945""" .

:OEO_00400041 a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "model system boundary"@en ;
    obo:IAO_0000115 "A model system boundary is a generically dependent continuant that is part of a model and separates aspects of the real world included in the model from those that are not." ;
    obo:IAO_0000119 "https://www.researchgate.net/publication/264816512_Classifying_and_communicating_uncertainties_in_model-based_policy_analysis" ;
    obo:IAO_0000233 """issue: https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/ontology/issues/1951
pull request: https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/ontology/pull/1977

Add 'model uncertainty location axiom'
issue:https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/ontology/issues/1829
pull request: https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/ontology/pull/1990

Add uncertainty axioms
issue:https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/ontology/issues/1989
pull request: https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/ontology/pull/2012""" ;
    rdfs:subClassOf [ a owl:Restriction ;
            owl:onProperty obo:BFO_0000050 ;
            owl:someValuesFrom :OEO_00000274 ],
        [ a owl:Restriction ;
            owl:onProperty obo:BFO_0000050 ;
            owl:someValuesFrom obo:RO_0002577 ],
        [ a owl:Restriction ;
            owl:onProperty obo:BFO_0000050 ;
            owl:someValuesFrom :OEO_00400040 ],
        [ a owl:Restriction ;
            owl:onProperty obo:RO_0000087 ;
            owl:someValuesFrom :OEO_00400022 ],
        obo:BFO_0000031 .

:OEO_00400042 a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "technical model implementation"@en ;
    obo:IAO_0000115 "A technical model implementation is a generically dependent continuant that is part of a model and consists of the hardware and software realization of a (conceptual) model." ;
    obo:IAO_0000118 "model code" ;
    obo:IAO_0000119 "https://www.researchgate.net/publication/264816512_Classifying_and_communicating_uncertainties_in_model-based_policy_analysis" ;
    obo:IAO_0000233 """issue: https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/ontology/issues/1953
pull request: https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/ontology/pull/1978

Add 'model uncertainty location axiom'
issue:https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/ontology/issues/1829
pull request: https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/ontology/pull/1990""" ;
    rdfs:subClassOf [ a owl:Restriction ;
            owl:onProperty obo:RO_0000087 ;
            owl:someValuesFrom :OEO_00400022 ],
        obo:BFO_0000031 .

:OEO_00400054 a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "wind power density"@en ;
    obo:IAO_0000115 "Wind power density (WPD) is a quantity value of the power wind has in a specific area." ;
    obo:IAO_0000118 "Windleistungsdichte"@de ;
    obo:IAO_0000233 """Issue: https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/ontology/pull/1997
Pull Request: https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/ontology/pull/2067""" ;
    rdfs:subClassOf [ a owl:Restriction ;
            owl:onProperty :OEO_00040010 ;
            owl:someValuesFrom obo:UO_0000155 ],
        :OEO_00000350 ;
    :OEO_00110012 "WPD = 0.5 * air density * ([wind speed]^3)." .

:OEO_00410012 a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "fauna flora habitat"@en ;
    obo:IAO_0000115 "A fauna flora habitat is a protected area that has the Fauna Flora Habitat role, aimed at conserving natural habitats and wild fauna and flora, within the European \"Natura 2000\" network of protected areas."@en ;
    obo:IAO_0000118 "Fauna Flora Habitat"@de ;
    rdfs:subClassOf :OEO_00240022 ;
    owl:equivalentClass [ a owl:Class ;
            owl:intersectionOf ( :OEO_00240022 [ a owl:Restriction ;
                        owl:onProperty obo:RO_0000087 ;
                        owl:someValuesFrom :OEO_00410010 ] ) ] ;
    :OEO_00020426 """issue: https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/ontology/issues/1962
pull request: https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/ontology/pull/1991""" .

:OEO_00410015 a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "biosphere reserve"@en ;
    obo:IAO_0000115 "A biosphere reserve is a protected area that has the biosphere reserve role, i.e. it is protected for conserving biodiversity, promoting sustainable development, and supporting research and education, within the UNESCO \"Man and the Biosphere\" (MAB) Programme."@en ;
    obo:IAO_0000118 "Biosphärenreservat"@de ;
    rdfs:subClassOf :OEO_00240022 ;
    owl:equivalentClass [ a owl:Class ;
            owl:intersectionOf ( :OEO_00240022 [ a owl:Restriction ;
                        owl:onProperty obo:RO_0000087 ;
                        owl:someValuesFrom :OEO_00410017 ] ) ] ;
    :OEO_00020426 """issue: https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/ontology/issues/1962
pull request: https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/ontology/pull/2006""" .

:OEO_00410016 a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "bird sanctuary"@en ;
    obo:IAO_0000115 "A bird sanctuary is a protected area that has the bird sanctuary role, which is aimed at protecting and conserving endangered and migratory bird species, within the European \"Natura 2000\" network of protected areas."@en ;
    obo:IAO_0000118 "Vogelschutzgebiet"@de ;
    rdfs:subClassOf :OEO_00240022 ;
    owl:equivalentClass [ a owl:Class ;
            owl:intersectionOf ( :OEO_00240022 [ a owl:Restriction ;
                        owl:onProperty obo:RO_0000087 ;
                        owl:someValuesFrom :OEO_00410008 ] ) ] ;
    :OEO_00020426 """issue: https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/ontology/issues/1962
pull request: https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/ontology/pull/1991""" .

:OEO_00410018 a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "protected landscape area"@en ;
    obo:IAO_0000115 "A protected landscape area is a protected area that has the protected landscape area role, i.e. it is aimed at conserving and enhancing the natural and cultural landscape, while allowing for sustainable land use and recreational activities."@en ;
    obo:IAO_0000118 "Landschaftsschutzgebiet"@de ;
    rdfs:subClassOf :OEO_00240022 ;
    owl:equivalentClass [ a owl:Class ;
            owl:intersectionOf ( :OEO_00240022 [ a owl:Restriction ;
                        owl:onProperty obo:RO_0000087 ;
                        owl:someValuesFrom :OEO_00410019 ] ) ] ;
    :OEO_00020426 """issue: https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/ontology/issues/1962
pull request: https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/ontology/pull/2006""" .

:OEO_00410021 a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "water protection area"@en ;
    obo:IAO_0000115 "A water protection area is a protected area that has the water protection area role, i.e. it is aimed at safeguarding the quality and quantity of water resources, including surface water and groundwater."@en ;
    obo:IAO_0000118 "Wasserschutzgebiet"@de ;
    rdfs:subClassOf :OEO_00240022 ;
    owl:equivalentClass [ a owl:Class ;
            owl:intersectionOf ( :OEO_00240022 [ a owl:Restriction ;
                        owl:onProperty obo:RO_0000087 ;
                        owl:someValuesFrom :OEO_00410022 ] ) ] ;
    :OEO_00020426 """issue: https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/ontology/issues/1962
pull request: https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/ontology/pull/2006""" .

:OEO_00410023 a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "floodplain"@en ;
    obo:IAO_0000115 "A floodplain is a region of relevance that has the floodplain role, i.e. for areas between surface waters and dykes or high banks and other areas that are flooded or flowed through during flooding of a surface water body or that are used for flood relief or retention."@en ;
    obo:IAO_0000118 "Überschwemmungsgebiet"@de ;
    rdfs:subClassOf :OEO_00360020 ;
    owl:equivalentClass [ a owl:Class ;
            owl:intersectionOf ( :OEO_00360020 [ a owl:Restriction ;
                        owl:onProperty obo:RO_0000087 ;
                        owl:someValuesFrom :OEO_00410024 ] ) ] ;
    :OEO_00020426 """issue: https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/ontology/issues/1962
pull request: https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/ontology/pull/2006""" .

:OEO_00410025 a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "forest"@en ;
    obo:IAO_0000115 "A forest is a region of relevance that has the forest role, i.e. it is planted with forest plants as well as clear-cut or thinned ground areas, forest paths, forest division and safety strips, forest openings and clearings, forest meadows, game grazing areas, wood storage areas and other areas connected to and serving the forest."@en ;
    obo:IAO_0000118 "Wald"@de ;
    rdfs:subClassOf :OEO_00360020 ;
    owl:equivalentClass [ a owl:Class ;
            owl:intersectionOf ( :OEO_00360020 [ a owl:Restriction ;
                        owl:onProperty obo:RO_0000087 ;
                        owl:someValuesFrom :OEO_00410026 ] ) ] ;
    :OEO_00020426 """issue: https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/ontology/issues/1962
pull request: https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/ontology/pull/2006""" .

:OEO_00410037 a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "arable land with high soil quality"@en ;
    obo:IAO_0000115 "An arable land with high soil quality is an arable land having some soil as part that can be categorized as having high soil quality."@en ;
    obo:IAO_0000118 "Ackerland mit hoher Bodenqualität"@de ;
    rdfs:subClassOf :OEO_00410036 ;
    owl:equivalentClass [ a owl:Class ;
            owl:intersectionOf ( :OEO_00410036 [ a owl:Restriction ;
                        owl:onProperty obo:RO_0000087 ;
                        owl:someValuesFrom :OEO_00410032 ] ) ] ;
    :OEO_00020426 """issue: https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/ontology/issues/1962
pull request: https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/ontology/pull/2006""" .

:OEO_00410038 a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "arable land with poor soil quality"@en ;
    obo:IAO_0000115 "An arable land with poor soil quality is an arable land having some soil as part that can be categorized as having poor soil quality."@en ;
    obo:IAO_0000118 "Ackerland mit geringer Bodenqualität"@de ;
    rdfs:subClassOf :OEO_00410036 ;
    owl:equivalentClass [ a owl:Class ;
            owl:intersectionOf ( :OEO_00410036 [ a owl:Restriction ;
                        owl:onProperty obo:RO_0000087 ;
                        owl:someValuesFrom :OEO_00410033 ] ) ] ;
    :OEO_00020426 """issue: https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/ontology/issues/1962
pull request: https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/ontology/pull/2006""" .

:OEO_00410070 a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "low rated voltage"@en ;
    obo:IAO_0000115 "A low rated voltage is a rated voltage usually used for the local distribution of electricity. Electricity at this voltage can be converted to a medium rated voltage. The usual producers feeding electricity into the grid at this voltage are smaller wind farms and solar installations. Households are the usual consumers receiving electricity at this voltage."@en ;
    obo:IAO_0000119 "https://www.smard.de/page/en/wiki-article/5884/214026" ;
    rdfs:subClassOf [ a owl:Restriction ;
            owl:hasValue :OEO_00410051 ;
            owl:onProperty www:ont00001942 ],
        [ a owl:Restriction ;
            owl:onProperty obo:IAO_0000136 ;
            owl:someValuesFrom :OEO_00110020 ],
        :OEO_00410068 ;
    :OEO_00020426 """first implementation
issue: https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/ontology/issues/2107
pull request: https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/ontology/pull/2108
add axiom to distribution grid
issue: https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/ontology/issues/2162
pull request: https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/ontology/pull/2197""" .

:OEO_00410071 a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "medium rated voltage"@en ;
    obo:IAO_0000115 "A medium rated voltage is a rated voltage usually used for the regional distribution of electricity. Electricity at this voltage can be converted to a high or low rated voltage. The usual producers feeding electricity into the grid at this voltage are wind and solar farms. Industries can be consumers receiving electricity at this voltage."@en ;
    obo:IAO_0000119 "https://www.smard.de/page/en/wiki-article/5884/214026" ;
    rdfs:subClassOf [ a owl:Restriction ;
            owl:onProperty obo:IAO_0000136 ;
            owl:someValuesFrom :OEO_00110020 ],
        [ a owl:Restriction ;
            owl:hasValue :OEO_00410052 ;
            owl:onProperty www:ont00001942 ],
        :OEO_00410068 ;
    :OEO_00020426 """first implementation
issue: https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/ontology/issues/2107
pull request: https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/ontology/pull/2108
add axiom to distribution grid
issue: https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/ontology/issues/2162
pull request: https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/ontology/pull/2197""" .

:OEO_00410072 a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "high rated voltage"@en ;
    obo:IAO_0000115 "A high rated voltage is a rated voltage usually used for the interregional distribution of electricity. Electricity at this voltage can be converted to an extra high or medium rated voltage. The usual producers feeding electricity into the grid at this voltage are natural gas and hydro power plants. Large-scale industries can be consumers receiving electricity at this voltage."@en ;
    obo:IAO_0000119 "https://www.smard.de/page/en/wiki-article/5884/214026" ;
    rdfs:subClassOf [ a owl:Restriction ;
            owl:hasValue :OEO_00410053 ;
            owl:onProperty www:ont00001942 ],
        [ a owl:Restriction ;
            owl:onProperty obo:IAO_0000136 ;
            owl:someValuesFrom :OEO_00110019 ],
        :OEO_00410068 ;
    :OEO_00020426 """first implementation
issue: https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/ontology/issues/2107
pull request: https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/ontology/pull/2108
add axiom to transmission grid
issue: https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/ontology/issues/2162
pull request: https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/ontology/pull/2197""" .

:OEO_00410073 a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "extra high rated voltage"@en ;
    obo:IAO_0000115 "An extra high rated voltage is a rated voltage usually used for the transmission of electricity. This is the usual voltage for electricity imports and exports. Electricity at this voltage can be converted to a high rated voltage. The usual producers feeding electricity into the grid at this voltage are coal and nuclear power plants, as well as offshore wind farms and hydro power plants."@en ;
    obo:IAO_0000119 "https://www.smard.de/page/en/wiki-article/5884/214026" ;
    rdfs:subClassOf [ a owl:Restriction ;
            owl:hasValue :OEO_00410054 ;
            owl:onProperty www:ont00001942 ],
        [ a owl:Restriction ;
            owl:onProperty obo:IAO_0000136 ;
            owl:someValuesFrom :OEO_00110019 ],
        :OEO_00410068 ;
    :OEO_00020426 """first implementation
issue: https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/ontology/issues/2107
pull request: https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/ontology/pull/2108
add axiom to transmission grid
issue: https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/ontology/issues/2162
pull request: https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/ontology/pull/2197""" .

:OEO_00420000 a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "simulation plan specification"@en ;
    obo:IAO_0000115 "A simulation scenario is a plan specification that references a simulation configuration and contains objective specifications to motivate the planned analysis."@en ;
    obo:IAO_0000118 "Simulationsszenario"@de,
        "simulation scenario"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "In the simulation community, the typical term for this concept is \"simulation scenario\", which denotes a different kind of scenario than the oeo:scenario (OEO_00000364). A simulation scenario might use an oeo:scenario as basis for its parametrisation."@en,
        "The bearer of the simulation plan specification is the researcher, starting the simulation and analysing the results."@en ;
    rdfs:subClassOf [ a owl:Restriction ;
            owl:onProperty obo:BFO_0000051 ;
            owl:someValuesFrom :OEO_00420001 ],
        obo:IAO_0000104 ;
    :OEO_00020426 """add
issue: https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/ontology/issues/2071
pull request: https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/ontology/pull/2125""" .

:OEO_00420003 a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "output data creation objective"@en ;
    obo:IAO_0000115 "An output data creation objective is an output creation objective that defines the goal to produce output data."@en ;
    rdfs:subClassOf :OEO_00420002 ;
    :OEO_00020426 """add
issue: https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/ontology/issues/2071
pull request: https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/ontology/pull/2125""" .

:OEO_00420004 a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "power line for vehicles"@en ;
    obo:IAO_0000115 "A power line for vehicles is a power line that is designed to transfer electrical energy to an electrically propelled vehicle. The conductor is installed alongside, above or embedded in the infrastructure used by the vehicles."@en ;
    rdfs:comment "For example third rail or catenary." ;
    rdfs:subClassOf :OEO_00000253 ;
    :OEO_00020426 """issue: https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/ontology/issues/2154
pull request: https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/ontology/pull/2191""" .

