    obo:BFO_0000050 :OEO_00010043 ;
    obo:IAO_0000115 """The CRF sector (IPCC 2006) 'agriculture, forestry and fishing' is an energy demand sector defined by the 2006 IPCC Guidelines for National Greenhouse Gas Inventories:
Emissions from fuel combustion in agriculture, forestry, fishing and fishing industries such as fish farms.""" ;
    obo:IAO_0000119 "2006 IPCC Guidelines for National Greenhouse Gas Inventories, Volume 2, Chapter 2.2, https://www.ipcc-nggip.iges.or.jp/public/2006gl/" ;
