:OEO_00010305 a [ a owl:Restriction ;
            owl:onProperty :OEO_00000504 ;
            owl:someValuesFrom :OEO_00010304 ],
        owl:NamedIndividual,
        :OEO_00000367 ;
    rdfs:label "NC/BR sector: energy"@en ;
    obo:BFO_0000051 :OEO_00010040,
        :OEO_00010043,
        :OEO_00010044,
        :OEO_00010057,
        :OEO_00010058 ;
    obo:IAO_0000115 """The NC/BR sector "energy" is a sector defined by an NC/BR sector division that includes all energy use that is not related to transport or industry. The sector includes:
- CRF sector (IPCC 2006): energy industry
- CRF sector (IPCC 2006): fuel combustion - other sectors
- CRF sector (IPCC 2006): fuel combustion - other
- CRF sector (IPCC 2006): fugitive emissions from fuels
- CRF sector (IPCC 2006): CO2 transport and storage""" ;
