    obo:BFO_0000051 :OEO_00010046,
        :OEO_00010160 ;
    obo:IAO_0000115 """The NC/BR sector "industry/industrial processes and product use" is an industry sector defined by an NC/BR sector division. The sector includes:
- CRF sector (IPCC 2006): manufacture of solid fuels and other energy industries
- CRF sector (IPCC 2006): industrial processes and product use""" ;
    :OEO_00020426 """issue: https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/ontology/issues/1273
pull request: https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/ontology/pull/1317

