Convert to equivalent class:
issue: https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/ontology/issues/1826
pull request: https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/ontology/pull/1906""" .

:OEO_00010472 a owl:ObjectProperty ;
    rdfs:label "has unit numerator"@en ;
    obo:IAO_0000115 "A relation between a (composed) unit A and a unit B in which B is in the numerator of unit A."@en ;
    obo:IAO_0000600 """A composed unit is composed of at least two other units. Examples are:
m/s has a linear numerator metre and a linear denominator second.
kg/m³ has a linear numerator kilogram and a cubed denominator metre.
Wh has two linear numerators: Watt and hour""" ;
    rdfs:domain :OEO_00010489 ;
    rdfs:range :OEO_00010489 ;
    rdfs:subPropertyOf obo:BFO_0000051 ;
    owl:propertyDisjointWith :OEO_00010476 ;
    :OEO_00020426 """issue: https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/ontology/issues/1815
pull request: https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/ontology/pull/1816

change domain and range to oeo:unit
issue: https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/ontology/issues/2135
pull request: https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/ontology/pull/2141""" .

:OEO_00010477 a owl:ObjectProperty ;
    rdfs:label "has linear unit denominator"@en ;
    obo:IAO_0000115 "A relation between a (composed) unit A and a unit B in which B is in the denominator of unit A with exponent 1."@en ;
    obo:IAO_0000600 """A composed unit is composed of at least two other units. Examples are:
m/s has a linear numerator metre and a linear denominator second.
kg/m³ has a linear numerator kilogram and a cubed denominator metre.
Wh has two linear numerators: Watt and hour""" ;
    rdfs:domain :OEO_00010489 ;
    rdfs:range :OEO_00010489 ;
    rdfs:subPropertyOf :OEO_00010476 ;
    owl:propertyDisjointWith :OEO_00010478,
        :OEO_00010479 ;
    :OEO_00020426 """issue: https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/ontology/issues/1815
pull request: https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/ontology/pull/1816

correct definition
pull request: https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/ontology/pull/2126

change domain and range to oeo:unit
issue: https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/ontology/issues/2135
pull request: https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/ontology/pull/2141""" .

