rework module structure 
issue: https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/ontology/issues/1592
pull request: https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/ontology/pull/1652""" .

<https://raw.githubusercontent.com/stap-m/midlevel-energy-ontology/main/ontology/src/midlevel-energy.owl/MENO_01043> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "combustion" ;
    obo:IAO_0000115 "Combustion is an energy transformation in which chemical energy from a fuel is transformed into thermal energy and other kinds of energy, e.g. radiative energy." ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/imports/meno-extracted.owl> ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <https://raw.githubusercontent.com/stap-m/midlevel-energy-ontology/main/ontology/src/midlevel-energy.owl/MENO_01003> ;
