:OEO_00240014 a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "electricity gain process"@en ;
    obo:IAO_0000115 "An electricity gain process is an energy transformation that has electrical energy as physical output."@en ;
    obo:IAO_0000118 "electricity generation",
        "electricity generation process" ;
    rdfs:comment "With the logical definition of electricity gain process, electrical energy transfer is inferred as subclass which is intended but depends on the perspective and the system boundaries. To avoid confusion, the main label was changed from electricity generation to electricity gain process." ;
    rdfs:subClassOf [ a owl:Restriction ;
            owl:onProperty :OEO_00000500 ;
            owl:someValuesFrom :OEO_00240013 ],
        [ a owl:Restriction ;
            owl:onProperty :OEO_00000500 ;
            owl:someValuesFrom :OEO_00240012 ],
        :OEO_00020003 ;
    owl:equivalentClass [ a owl:Restriction ;
            owl:onProperty :OEO_00020461 ;
            owl:someValuesFrom :OEO_00000139 ] ;
    :OEO_00020426 """issue: https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/ontology/issues/917
pull request: https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/ontology/pull/932

change 'has physical input / output' axioms to 'has energy input / output':
https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/ontology/issues/994
https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/ontology/pull/1041

Add alternative label and improve definition:
issue: https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/ontology/issues/1455
pull request: https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/ontology/pull/1562

rework module structure 
issue: https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/ontology/issues/1592
pull request: https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/ontology/pull/1652

replace energy-participant axioms and relabel
