[] a owl:Axiom ;
    owl:annotatedProperty obo:IAO_0000116 ;
    owl:annotatedSource obo:IAO_0000033 ;
    owl:annotatedTarget "2013-05-30 Alan Ruttenberg: What differentiates a directive information entity from an information concretization is that it can have concretizations that are either qualities or realizable entities. The concretizations that are realizable entities are created when an individual chooses to take up the direction, i.e. has the intention to (try to) realize it."@en ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/releases/2.13.0/imports/iao-extracted.owl> .

